# The mobile build image bakes only the npm dependencies; sources are mounted
# at run time. Keeping the context to the lockfiles makes the per-build
# `compose build mobile` a cache hit until one of them changes.
*
!frontend/package.json
!frontend/package-lock.json
!mobile/package.json
!mobile/package-lock.json
!mobile/tool/harden_native_purchases.sh
